{
  "abstract": "New results on inclusive lambda polarization in K \u2212 p interactions at 14.3 GeV/ c are presented. At the kaon fragmentation vertex, the polarization is compared to that from inclusive experiments at lower momenta and to that from two-body reactions with a \u039b. As predicted by the triple-Regge model with N \u03b1 (or N \u03b3 ) exchange, the polarization is found to be independent of s and M X 2 / s . In particular it has the same value as that found in the two-body reactions.",
